# AI governance generated by `spec-driven-guide init`
# This repo is the generator: the `.ai/kit/` tree mirrors src/assets/, whose source
# of truth is already versioned, and the managed block below ignores it by name.
# Only the root files the CLI assembles are added here, since a generator has no
# reason to carry its own rendered output.
.ai/.sdg-manifest.json
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# >>> spec-driven-guide, managed block
# Rewritten whole on every init. Lines outside the markers are yours.

# Environment: never commit secrets
.env
.env.*

# SDG kit: written by the CLI, pinned by the manifest
.ai/kit/

# AI artifacts: session state, not project logic
.ai/backlog/session.md
.ai/backlog/impact-map.md
tmp/
temp/

